! RFC 6962 — Certificate Transparency

A reference meme. It carries RFC 6962's own bibliographic facts — fetched from rfc-editor.org,
never invented — in `[reference]` above, so a pin at this address cites the work itself.
Superseded by `lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/ref/RFC-9162`; this carrier stands because canon cites
both versions.

